I'll create a self-contained HTML file that replicates the classic 1978 Taito arcade game "Aster" (note: the original request mentions "aders" which appears to be a typo for "Asteroids" - but I'll create a faithful recreation of the classic Taito arcade experience with Space Invaders-inspired mechanics).

Let me build a complete Space Invaders game in a single HTML file.

